Let's see there's Passade Tota,

00:29:09.340 --> 00:29:11.290
did I play any sports when I was young?

00:29:12.274 --> 00:29:16.520
I wasn't your stereotypical
super athlete type person.

00:29:16.520 --> 00:29:19.070
I played in the
neighborhood with other kids

00:29:19.070 --> 00:29:22.470
in the apartment that I lived in.

00:29:22.470 --> 00:29:25.940
The only sport I ever did,
kind of in an organized way,

00:29:25.940 --> 00:29:29.560
I was on the wrestling team in 10th grade.

00:29:29.560 --> 00:29:32.960
And I enjoyed it, I wasn't bad.

00:29:32.960 --> 00:29:36.220
But my only trophy of
substance in wrestling

00:29:36.220 --> 00:29:38.680
was having the highest
GPA on the wrestling team.

00:29:38.680 --> 00:29:41.932
So you can take that for what it's worth.

00:29:41.932 --> 00:29:43.852
(laughing)

00:29:43.852 --> 00:29:46.350
On that note, I will let everybody,

00:29:46.350 --> 00:29:49.810
this is what I always really
enjoy these "Ask Me Anything".

00:29:49.810 --> 00:29:51.340
Hopefully y'all enjoy it, too.

00:29:51.340 --> 00:29:53.990
But I'm late for a
meeting I just realized.

00:29:53.990 --> 00:29:55.890
So thank everyone for joining.

